/*
 * Variational Quantum Eigensolver (VQE) with UCCSD ansatz on 4 qubits.
 *
 * VQE is a hybrid quantum-classical algorithm for finding the
 * ground-state energy of a molecular Hamiltonian. It prepares a
 * parameterized trial state (ansatz) on the quantum computer,
 * measures the energy expectation value, and uses a classical
 * optimizer to adjust the parameters until the energy is minimized.
 *
 * This circuit uses the Unitary Coupled Cluster Singles and Doubles
 * (UCCSD) ansatz, which models electron excitations from occupied to
 * virtual orbitals. Single excitations move one electron, while
 * double excitations move two simultaneously.
 *
 */


